cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pacs008-mcp in research or production write-ups, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "pacs008-mcp: Model Context Protocol server for ISO 20022 FI-to-FI credit transfers"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol server exposing the pacs008 library to AI agents:
  sixteen tools for discovering ISO 20022 pacs message types and scheme
  profiles, validating records and XML, generating validated pacs.008
  messages, parsing inbound messages, converting legacy MT103 and checking
  postal addresses against the structured-address rules.
authors:
